  "helpFaq": "Frequently asked",
  "helpQ1": "How do I post a load?",
  "helpA1": "Tap Post Load, enter the route and pickup time, describe the cargo and choose a vehicle. Review it and post. Carriers can bid straight away.",
  "helpQ2": "Why can I only have 3 open requests?",
  "helpA2": "From the mobile app you can have up to {max} requests that are awaiting bids, confirmed, scheduled or in transit at once. Delivered, cancelled and expired requests free up a slot. For more volume, use the LODBOD web platform.",
  "@helpA2": {"placeholders": {"max": {"type": "int"}}},
  "helpQ3": "How do I choose a bid?",
  "helpA3": "Open your shipment and tap Compare bids. You can sort by price, rating or delivery time and open any offer for details. Nothing is booked until you confirm.",
  "helpQ4": "Can I cancel a shipment?",
  "helpA4": "Yes, until pickup. Open the shipment, tap the ⋮ menu and choose Cancel shipment. Open bids are declined.",
  "helpQ5": "Where is my truck?",
  "helpA5": "Booked shipments have a Track shipment screen with the route, checkpoints and estimated arrival. In this version tracking is simulated from the schedule.",
  "helpQ6": "Will I lose an unfinished load?",
  "helpA6": "No. Drafts are saved to your account when you close Post Load or tap Save draft, so you can finish them later.",
  "helpStillNeed": "Still need help?",
  "helpStillNeedBody": "Send us a message and the team will get back to you.",
  "helpMessage": "Message",

  "legalSummaryUpdated": "Summary · updated 8 Nov 2026",
  "legalT1": "Using LODBOD",
  "legalT1Body": "LODBOD connects shippers with independent carriers. You must provide accurate details about your loads, routes and contacts.",
  "legalT2": "Posting loads",
  "legalT2Body": "A posted load is an invitation for carriers to bid. Mobile accounts can have up to 3 open requests at a time; additional requests can be created on the LODBOD web platform.",
  "legalT3": "Bids and bookings",
  "legalT3Body": "A booking is made only when you accept a bid and confirm it. Accepting one bid declines the others for that load.",
  "legalT4": "Cancellations",
  "legalT4Body": "You can cancel a request before pickup. Repeated late cancellations may affect your access.",
  "legalT5": "Payments",
  "legalT5Body": "Fares are agreed between you and the carrier in Nepali rupees. Payment terms are shown before you confirm a booking.",
  "legalP1": "What we collect",
  "legalP1Body": "Your name, phone number, email, company, and the details of loads you post, bids you receive and bookings you make.",
  "legalP2": "How we use it",
  "legalP2Body": "To run your account, show your loads to carriers, process bookings, send service messages and improve LODBOD.",
  "legalP3": "What carriers see",
  "legalP3Body": "Carriers see your company name, the route, cargo and schedule. Your phone number is shared only with the carrier you book.",
  "legalP4": "Your choices",
  "legalP4Body": "You can update your profile at any time and control in-app alerts from Account.",
  "legalP5": "Security",
  "legalP5Body": "Your data is stored with industry-standard encryption in transit and at rest.",

